OL,3,AStorm Boelo amber warnings kick in as
OL,4,Aparts of UK brace for 80mph gusts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmber weather warnings have come into
OL,7,Fforce in Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,8,Fnorthern England as Storm Boelo
OL,9,Fcontinues to move across the UK, with
OL,10,Fwind gusts up to 80mph forecast in the
OL,11,Fworst-hit areas.
OL,13,FStrong winds and heavy showers will
OL,14,Fintensify through Saturday night, with
OL,15,Fwidespread gusts expected.
OL,17,FThe amber warning for Scotland and
OL,18,FEngland will stay in place until 21:00
OL,19,Fon Sunday, bringing an increased risk
OL,20,Fof travel disruption and potential risk
OL,21,Fto life.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
