OL,3,AUkraine says Starlink connection 'now
OL,4,Astable' after network limits
OL,5,
OL,6,FDefence Minister Yevhenii Khmara said
OL,7,Fthat speeds of more than 400km/h were
OL,8,Fnow possible on the network, indicating
OL,9,Fthat full capability had been restored.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
