OL,3,APalestinian families displaced as
OL,4,AIsraeli forces demolish Hebron homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operation was announced by Prime
OL,7,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu on Friday,
OL,8,Fin response to the killing of two
OL,9,FIsraeli soldiers by two Palestinian
OL,10,Fgunmen in an attack on a checkpoint.
OL,11,FThree other Israeli soldiers were
OL,12,Finjured, and the gunmen were also
OL,13,Fkilled.
OL,15,FNetanyahu said on Friday that buildings
OL,16,Faround the site of the attack and the
OL,17,Fneighbourhoods that the two gunmen were
OL,18,Ffrom would be "destroyed".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
