OL,3,AMan arrested after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,Amountaintop Eagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 200 emergency personnel were
OL,7,Fdeployed to the scene where the blaze
OL,8,Fwas still burning early on Saturday, as
OL,9,Fpolice said difficult terrain hindered
OL,10,Fefforts to bring the fire under
OL,11,Fcontrol.
OL,13,FPolice said they apprehended the man
OL,14,Friding a motorcycle near the scene,
OL,15,FGerman media reported. A criminal
OL,16,Finvestigation has been launched.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
